cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Orchard weed and tree trunk mapping
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it
  belongs to.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Afonso Sabino Sola
    family-names: Ruivo
    affiliation: Instituto Superior Tecnico, Universidade de Lisboa
  - given-names: Alberto
    family-names: Vale
    affiliation: >-
      Instituto de Plasmas e Fusao Nuclear, Instituto Superior Tecnico,
      Universidade de Lisboa
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/OWNER/orchard-weed-mapping
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and tools for mapping the weeds and tree trunks of an orchard from
  a single pass of a ground platform carrying a LiDAR, an IMU, a colour camera
  and a GNSS receiver, with a GNSS-independent evaluation against a trunk
  survey.
keywords:
  - precision agriculture
  - LiDAR-inertial odometry
  - weed mapping
  - trunk detection
references:
  - type: dataset
    title: >-
      Orchard multisensor dataset: session CB-11, calibration, trunk survey
      and labelled images
    authors:
      - given-names: Afonso Sabino Sola
        family-names: Ruivo
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23805668
  - type: dataset
    title: "Orchard multisensor dataset: session CA-10"
    authors:
      - given-names: Afonso Sabino Sola
        family-names: Ruivo
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23808549
